# A talk that Stand's brain prepares for a meeting stays on the Mac it was made on: it
# may be about a system that is nobody else's business. The two kept here are Stand's
# own: the talk that introduces it, and the one prepared about this repository, which a
# test gives. A new talk that should ship with Stand has to be named below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/introducing-stand.md
!/how-stand-works-inside.md
